WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.604
Every proposal takes half a day.

2
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.809
Rate cards, scope, chasing approval by text.

3
00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:07.611
And in the rush,

4
00:00:07.611 --> 00:00:11.370
a twelve percent discount takes the margin from thirty-nine to thirty.

5
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.810
So we built Proposal and Quote Agent.

6
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.351
It reads the brief and pulls out every requirement,

7
00:00:16.351 --> 00:00:17.840
with the line it came from.

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.650
It prices the work from your rate card in seconds.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.379
Move the discount, and the margin moves with it.

10
00:00:33.379 --> 00:00:35.362
Below the floor, it goes to the partner.

11
00:00:35.362 --> 00:00:37.050
Above it, it's ready to send.

12
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.340
And once it's sent, the price is locked.

13
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.285
Proposals out in minutes,

14
00:00:56.285 --> 00:00:58.590
at a price someone with authority chose.

15
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.470
The discount is a decision. Never a slip.
